  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:08.840" end="00:16.840" ttm:agent="v1">I'm so inlove, like babygirl why did you have to lead me on?</p>
      <p begin="00:19.500" end="00:23.340" ttm:agent="v1">And every time I think of you I just sing this song</p>
      <p begin="00:23.340" end="00:26.720" ttm:agent="v1">I've been feelin numb, I've been feeling numb</p>
      <p begin="00:26.720" end="00:30.170" ttm:agent="v1">I've been feeling wrong you been feelin' right</p>
      <p begin="00:30.170" end="00:33.420" ttm:agent="v1">I've been waiting long, I've been waiting all night</p>
      <p begin="00:33.420" end="00:37.130" ttm:agent="v1">Callin' your phone even when we get in fights, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:37.130" end="00:41.720" ttm:agent="v1">Never get along which is why we seem to die, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:41.720" end="00:47.230" ttm:agent="v1">I'm so inlove, like babygirl why did you have to lead me on?</p>
      <p begin="00:47.230" end="00:50.610" ttm:agent="v1">And every time I think of you I just sing this song</p>
      <p begin="00:50.610" end="00:54.040" ttm:agent="v1">I've been feelin numb, I've been feeling numb</p>
      <p begin="00:54.040" end="00:57.380" ttm:agent="v1">I've been feeling wrong you been feelin' right</p>
      <p begin="00:57.380" end="01:00.700" ttm:agent="v1">I've been waiting long, I've been waiting all night</p>
      <p begin="01:00.700" end="01:04.280" ttm:agent="v1">Callin' your phone even whеn we get in fights, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:04.280" end="01:09.280" ttm:agent="v1">Nеver get along which is why we seem to die</p>
      <p begin="01:09.280" end="01:12.350" ttm:agent="v1">And babygirl, yeah you are special</p>
      <p begin="01:12.350" end="01:15.840" ttm:agent="v1">I can stare all day at your freckles</p>
      <p begin="01:15.840" end="01:19.190" ttm:agent="v1">Lovin' someone can be stressful</p>
      <p begin="01:19.190" end="01:22.640" ttm:agent="v1">I've been asking all when we can settle</p>
      <p begin="01:22.640" end="01:26.410" ttm:agent="v1">I'm so happy but I feel so down</p>
      <p begin="01:26.410" end="01:30.190" ttm:agent="v1">Feeling so alive when you come around</p>
      <p begin="01:30.190" end="01:37.050" ttm:agent="v1">You wanna leave me but you feel so bound, feel so bound, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:37.050" end="01:40.520" ttm:agent="v1">Dreamin' 'bout places that we can go</p>
      <p begin="01:40.520" end="01:43.720" ttm:agent="v1">Walks on the beach, or our hands in snow</p>
      <p begin="01:43.720" end="01:47.340" ttm:agent="v1">And now that you're gone, I just walk alone</p>
      <p begin="01:47.340" end="01:50.780" ttm:agent="v1">Walk alone, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:50.780" end="01:56.040" ttm:agent="v1">I'm so love, like babygirl why did you have to lead me on?</p>
      <p begin="01:56.040" end="01:59.280" ttm:agent="v1">And every time I think of you I just sing this song</p>
      <p begin="01:59.280" end="02:02.740" ttm:agent="v1">I've been feelin numb, I've been feeling numb</p>
      <p begin="02:02.740" end="02:06.040" ttm:agent="v1">I've been feeling wrong you been feelin right</p>
      <p begin="02:06.040" end="02:09.590" ttm:agent="v1">I've been waiting long, I've been waiting all night</p>
      <p begin="02:09.590" end="02:13.090" ttm:agent="v1">Callin' your phone even when we get in fights, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:13.090" end="02:17.950" ttm:agent="v1">Never get along which is why we seem to die</p>
